        # acos(|x|) = sqrt(1-|x|) * P3(|x|); acos(x) = pi - acos(|x|) for x < 0.
        # One sqrt, no division. Domain-wide max abs error ~8.6e-5 (< evaluator
        # atol). sqrt(1-|x|) with |x| > 1 yields NaN, matching torch.acos.
